Yes, it is a shell script (you need to run it via sh on *nix). It just
shows you the idea, and you can use any language to implement it, e.g.
in R, it can be

while (TRUE) {
  system2("make")
  Sys.sleep(1)
}

Press Ctrl + C or Esc (depending on your platform) to stop it.

Regards,
Yihui
